# The users page named each connection's wrapper and table from its label; the table is now
# `admin-user-table-<position>` (its testid too) and the wrapper has no id.
user-table-<label> -> !
Users-<label> -> !

# Tables: RemoteTable took its ids from `tableName`, which is also the rows-per-page storage key
# and the caption; it takes an `id` prop now. Its rows are `<id>-row-<n>`, their cells
# `<id>-row-<n>-col-<m>`, an expanded row `<id>-active-row-<n>`, the keyboard help `<id>-kbd-help`.
# The dashboard's table was also `ExplorerTable`; it is `dashboard-table` now (renamed by hand).
ExplorerTable-table -> explorer-table
ExplorerTable-row-<part> -> explorer-table-row-<part>
ExplorerTable-active-row-<part> -> explorer-table-active-row-<part>
ExplorerTable-kbd-help -> explorer-table-kbd-help
